<title>INDIA: Indian Oct industrial output up 9.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Indian Oct industrial output up 9.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's index of industrial production increased by 9.9 percent in October over the same month in 1995, the government said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The government said in a monthly report that the index increased by 9.8 percent during April to October over the same seven-month period in 1995.  </p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION     Oct 96    Sep 96    Oct 95</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	  +9.9	+9.5	+9.1</p>
<p>     -Mining			 +5.5	+1.8	+2.3</p>
<p>     -Manufacturing	     +11.0     +11.4     +10.9</p>
<p>     -Electricity		  +6.9	+3.7	+5.0</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1980/81)  301.3     303.4     274.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures for October 1996 are preliminary. Figures for September 1996 have been revised.  </p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    CUMULATIVE			 Apr-Oct 96    Apr-Oct 95</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change		+9.8	    +11.7</p>
<p>     -Mining			     +1.7	     +9.8</p>
<p>     -Manufacturing		   +12.1	    +12.3</p>
<p>     -Electricity			+3.4	    +10.1</p>
<p>     Index (base 100=1980/81)     291.2	    265.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures for April-October 1996 are preliminary.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
